Bundled third-party code
------------------------

None. The released main.js is produced by esbuild from the files in src/ and imports only Obsidian's
own API and Node.js built-in modules (node:https, node:crypto, node:events). Obsidian's API is provided
by the host application at runtime and is not redistributed here.

